client/operation-metrics.mjs adapts the percentile calculation, bounded push
buffer and numeric request-record/summary approach. Room removes channel/session
identifiers, browser observers, timers, user-agent and URLs, adds fixed operation
labels and input validation, reports p95 and dropped records, and defaults off.
No Buzz artwork, fonts, branding or bundled third-party product assets are used.
